{"id":"chatcmpl-eacef5f0-b198-46f9-9dbc-6ae94833878a","object":"chat.completion","created":1795245963,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"{\n  \"highlights\": \"The task required distinguishing between two similar findings (right vs. left lower lobe atelectasis) on a lateral chest X-ray, where laterality is challenging. The strategy involved querying multiple independent expert models to obtain laterality opinions, then synthesizing their outputs and verifying the consensus. The successful outcome relied on cross-validation and cautious interpretation of conflicting or non-specific model responses.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When distinguishing between two similar options that differ by a spatial attribute (e.g., laterality), query multiple independent models for that specific attribute and aggregate their opinions.\",\n    \"If initial model responses are non-specific or incoherent, escalate by querying additional models with more targeted questions until a consistent signal emerges.\",\n    \"Use a verification step to audit the proposed answer against the original evidence, especially when model outputs conflict or are uncertain.\",\n    \"In final reasoning, weight models that provide explicit, confident answers over those that are vague, and note any caveats from verification.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical Imaging Interpretation\": \"For ambiguous spatial findings, consult multiple AI models and cross-check their outputs; prioritize models that give clear localizations.\",\n    \"Multiple-Choice Question Answering\": \"When options differ by a single attribute, design queries that directly ask for that attribute and use consensus among independent sources.\",\n    \"Decision Making Under Uncertainty\": \"If sources conflict, gather additional opinions and perform a verification step before committing to an answer.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm that the proposed answer is supported by at least one explicit, confident model output.\",\n    \"Review verification feedback for any caveats and ensure the final answer aligns with the strongest evidence.\"\n  ]\n}"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":755,"total_tokens":1106,"completion_tokens":351,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":755},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":351}}}